623335", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HmE9DU-0Hn4Q7kNvwE5lCw4&_nc_oc=AdqU3RCIT0B1i1FUe0lqlP78DwGVhF3M_AJIU6cCYWMU38nke-K5ZIwsTOxu2aRBxhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI8qFqyPhXDlPsW4e1JFkg9UckF3PgeaqmMNBwrV_JSBQ&oe=6A9C1862"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rrqWn9AjHuoQ7kNvwHziZCj&_nc_oc=Adov25zG3ECT8HRnG13SBVZ3RjVhnlHrMwCakeZ9UqZ0X3qzHy-oGpTPd-_3cI61XvE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIG0-Og33lvSRY6WhLEeEn18xb51OO4SekeEGmYZXs-dA&oe=6A9C25F3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F5hEQ9SmWIYQ7kNvwGeG3OM&_nc_oc=AdoPSEpSgR9ZFWiFcbYeeDaWwAkazZj582V3uEGA_b8jhI4v1umfN10PLPkA9DsYy_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL9UiOzL7cwG7qp60Rxx3eUtEVnhBMu6NmzDbeG9c6xPw&oe=6A9C1A6B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ATqTsojnJXoQ7kNvwH5F0Um&_nc_oc=AdrMzUm4snykasMbRwatzfCLQEOK1shlU58RAenWNFN-jSvlTtYDq3hrHWjF8EeyCXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKgCRknXMQc5OAZvMEu1ygwa3fnW1J3KwnqoEROGJND3Q&oe=6A9C37A2"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b7QxvK9502MQ7kNvwGpYmM3&_nc_oc=AdqUVFYT3EvEBaZU-Pf6ZVW06Ec6apTFc1P0gn2_e4tmHlBG6xwpbOC0nqvaBLBRQp0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJXbBCMA1EdByar7HAe7sBojuEsc9PtEdIcx9wo61pcOQ&oe=6A9C3A3D"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292